    // rows (C-350, 16:16): c6 and vr5nr valid (O-286 (a); O-375 Q1 (a): `return x` reads x's value); vi3l, vl1l and opc5 invalid with a
    // Language record, the region bounded by its value (piece (iv)); vl1c and vcc1l an unproven constraint; vl1cn a constraint and a
    // relation record. us1 keeps only its Loan conflict (O-375 Q1 (a)); us1v (`var x`) reads x's region. The veqz family (design-ii.md
